{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/920994-forsaken-poland","id":920994,"title":"Forsaken Poland","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-25T09:37:49-07:00","id":920994,"title":"Forsaken Poland","content":"Hello, I am setting up a Facebook Vampire the Requiem and Werewolf the Forsaken venue and need a bit of help with brainstorming ideas for the Werewolf NPC's. The game takes place in Gdansk in 1656 when the city was under a siege from Sweden that lasted 5 years, but I need to get some ideas for the local leadership for the Forsaken in and around the city.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10343-the-anubi","name":"The Anubi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T22:55:48-07:00","id":921362,"title":"","content":"I'm not from Gda\u0144sk ( as I'm from Lublin, way on south of Poland ) but can help brainstorm something. I heard that <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1757_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1757\" data-vbnamecard=\"1757\">Acrozatarim</a> has close family from Poland also. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Generally - Poland of 1650's is large European power ( or rather of that time Polish\u2013Lithuanian Commonwealth ). It's start to shake - that's why we have <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deluge_(history)\" target=\"_blank\">Swedish Deluge</a> started in the first place - but still is magnificent empire of that era, torn slowly by ill-advised rulings of Sejm under <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liberum_veto\" target=\"_blank\">Liberum Veto</a> rule. Gda\u0144sk of that era is THE port of this agriculture hegemon and by this one of most important cities in country.<br /> <br /> As to Forsaken faction split - remember that Gda\u0144sk is city of commerce and trade. It's bound by the Baltic Sea, so Sea Court spirits could be way to mark this. Maybe interesting would be to make some Protectorates, as it's highlight political bend of the settlement.<br /> <br /> As to Tribes - I can see this a highly Iron Masters and Bone Shadows infused place. Masters are obvious with their focus on humans and Bone Shadows works as pleasing various spirits of sea or many cultures that cross this region. As to Hosts - Rats are spreading most quickly on ships so I imagine <i>Beshilu</i> is large part of problem for Hunters in Darkness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-26-2016, 01:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T10:14:08-07:00","id":921541,"title":"","content":"You can also watch remastered <b>Deluge</b> 1974 movie of Andrzej Wajda with English subtitles based on Henryk Sienkiewicz novel. It's exactly the time period story.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=